# Web3Forms — get a free access key at https://web3forms.com
# 1. Create an account and verify your email.
# 2. Create a form and copy its Access Key.
# 3. Paste the key below. It is public and safe to ship in the client bundle.
#
# Web3Forms emails the complete submission (name, email, subject, message)
# to the address you verified. Configure the subject/template from the
# Web3Forms dashboard.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
